{comment}
  The theme's FRAME (decided 2026-10-20): the header, breadcrumbs and footer every page is drawn in, with the page's
  own content at the content tag, drawn by the renderer its type names (content/<type>). Where a page lives picks
  its frame; this is the default wherever nothing names another.
{endcomment}
